to several alchemists.\n\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Prague, Czech Republic]]\n[[Category:The Organization]]\n[[Category:Organization bases]]","text":"* The Road of Alchemists is based on Golden Lane, a street in Prague known for being home to several alchemists."}],"full_text":"The Road of Alchemists in Prague, Czech Republic, was where Jodis Lore once maintained the Golem's Attic and hid his Metagolem Amulet. The door to the Golem's Attic was protected with powerful magic so that only Jodis Lore's Key could open the door. After Dante retrieved the Metagolem Amulet and the mission was completed, the Organization turned it into an safehouse. [Chasing Void]\n\n== Trivia ==\n\n* The Road of Alchemists is based on Golden Lane, a street in Prague known for being home to several alchemists.","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox location\n| aka = Alchemists' Road\n| image       = File:S2E31_Alchemists Road.png\n| type        = Road\n| level       = \n| location    = [[Prague, Czech Republic]]\n| inhabitants = [[Suits]]\n| former = [[Jodis Lore]] †\n| first = \"[[Words of Truth, Heart of Lies|Words of Truth,<br>Heart of Lies]]\n}}'''The Road of Alchemists''' in [[Prague, Czech Republic]], was where [[Jodis Lore]] once maintained the [[Golem's Attic]] and hid his [[Metagolem]] [[Amulet]]. The door to the Golem's Attic was protected with powerful magic so that only [[Jodis Lore's Key]] could open the door. After Dante retrieved the Metagolem Amulet and the mission was completed, [[the Organization]] turned it into an safehouse. {{Source|Chasing Void}}\n\n== Trivia ==\n\n* The Road of Alchemists is based on [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golden_Lane Golden Lane], a street in Prague known for being home to several alchemists.\n\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Prague, Czech Republic]]\n[[Category:The Organization]]\n[[Category:Organization bases]]","categories":["Locations","Organization bases","Prague, Czech Republic","The Organization"],"links":[{"target_title":"Prague, Czec